"user_name_real":"周甲德律师","uid":1000617,"ctime":1551430112,"ip_address":"","comment_id":63866,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100020001,"comment_content":"周老师，有个案例请教下：朋友投了一家私募基金，大概好几十万呢，2018年12月到期，目前这家公司到期无法偿还本金和利息，一直拖着，朋友找这家公司的老板多次讨要无果，也没报案。有什么好的办法和措施能要回本金吗？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1000617,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/44/a9/4bd691b2.jpg","nickname":"周甲德律师","note":"","ucode":"76C5CD2C51952B","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":437739,"discussion_content":"公司要是人去楼空了，及时报警吧，这种时候他们欠的多了，要也不会给。","content_length":33,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1551430112,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":44431,"user_name":"bb.dry","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1009317,"ip_address":"","ucode":"EB3DA414872F94","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/66/a5/53ab7a9d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1543446382,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":15953,"content":"报警的人多了，就查处了。很多人都是觉得自己不会是最倒霉的那一个","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"周甲德律师","uid":1000617,"ctime":1543475811,"ip_address":"","comment_id":44431,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100020001,"comment_content":"老师您好，现在有很多资金盘，互助盘，利息都非常高。需要收集怎样的证据才能给他们定罪呢？身边很多朋友玩这个，最后被割了韭菜，都没办法。顶多弄一个维权的微信群，然后一点用都没有。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1000617,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/44/a9/4bd691b2.jpg","nickname":"周甲德律师","note":"","ucode":"76C5CD2C51952B","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":""